TY  - JOUR
T1  - The benchmark illusion: on the curious underestimation of AI and the uncertainty of its creators’ gold standards
AU  - Pohlkamp, Christian
AU  - Haferlach, Torsten
JO  - eClinicalMedicine
VL  - 99
SP  - 104184
PY  - 2026
DA  - 2026/09/01/
