T1  - Performance Gaps and Optimization Strategies in Chinese Medical Large Language Models Based on MedBench: Evaluation Study
AU  - Jiang, Luyi
AU  - Chen, Jiayuan
AU  - Lu, Lu
AU  - Peng, Xinwei
AU  - Liu, Lihao
AU  - He, Junjun
